{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2024-06/1064884/block/singleImage/3273493/df/0020_7.jpg?updatedAt=1795161245\"/><figcaption>小西灣邨37歲女房內自縊，家人揭發惜太遲。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (20 日 ) 上午 10 時 27 分，警方接獲市民報案，指發現其家人在柴灣小西灣邨瑞福樓一單位一房間上吊。 人員接報到場，消防將該名 37 歲姓陳女子解下，她現場被證實死亡。經初步調查，發現事主以一尼龍繩上吊。警方於現場檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.582030+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:54:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T23:49:26.507166+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:18.123324+00:00","content_hash":"1c4ed62e37c41394e97d25a4f356811873ea1526eff40720d0dfbecc4d02c05d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}